  <keyword>nelson.unittest.skip</keyword>
  <short_description>Skip the current test.</short_description>
  <syntax>
    <syntax_item>nelson.unittest.skip()</syntax_item>
    <syntax_item>nelson.unittest.skip(reason)</syntax_item>
    <syntax_item>nelson.unittest.skip(condition, reason)</syntax_item>
  </syntax>
  <description>
    <p><b>nelson.unittest.skip</b> marks the current test as skipped. <b>skip_testsuite</b> is the
      compatibility alias.</p>
  </description>
